    <node id="Immune Suppression">
      <data key="d0">Immune Suppression</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A risk factor for basal cell skin cancer, often from organ transplants or autoimmune diseases.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788682775</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Recurrence">
      <data key="d0">Recurrence</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The return of basal cell skin cancer to the original area or spread to lymph nodes or distant parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The return of cancer after treatment, also called relapse.&lt;SEP&gt;The return of cancer after treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The return of cancer after treatment; risk is related to tumor grade.&lt;SEP&gt;The return of cancer after treatment, which surveillance aims to detect early.&lt;SEP&gt;The return of cervical cancer after treatment, or persistent cancer that does not improve.&lt;SEP&gt;The return of cancer after a cancer-free period.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-048&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-090&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-108&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-140&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-142&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-143&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-147&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-152&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-191</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788682775</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="NCCN Patient Guides for Cancer App">
      <data key="d0">NCCN Patient Guides for Cancer App</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The NCCN Patient Guides for Cancer App is a mobile application developed by the National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) that provides patient-friendly versions of its clinical guidelines, known as the NCCN Guidelines for Patients. The app serves as a comprehensive resource for cancer patients, offering access to a wide range of condition-specific guides, including those for lung cancer, colon cancer, colorectal cancer, liver cancer, throat cancer, mouth cancer, and acute lymphoblastic leukemia (ALL). It also includes specialized guides such as the NCCN Guideline for Patients: Early-Stage Prostate Cancer, the NCCN Guidelines for Patients: Adolescent and Young Adult Cancer, and resources on Hodgkin lymphoma in children and adolescents.

Beyond disease-specific information, the app addresses supportive care topics, providing guidance on managing side effects such as nausea and vomiting, as well as broader side-effect management strategies. It also covers fertility preservation options for patients undergoing cancer treatment and includes a dedicated guideline on distress, helping patients cope with the emotional and psychological challenges of a cancer diagnosis. The app is designed to deliver clear, accessible cancer information and guidelines directly to users, making it a valuable tool for patients seeking reliable, NCCN-endorsed educational content on their mobile devices.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-047&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-057&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-058&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-060&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-063&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-066&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-069&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-076&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-088&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-093&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-094&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-096&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-101&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-106&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-108&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-118&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-122&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-123&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-125&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-126&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-130&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-135&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-136&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-145&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chun