    <node id="Chapter 3: Types of Treatment">
      <data key="d0">Chapter 3: Types of Treatment</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A chapter in the NCCN Guidelines for Patients that explains different types of cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A chapter in the book that gives a general overview of AML treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-067</data>
