    <node id="Adenoma">
      <data key="d0">Adenoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The most common type of adrenal gland tumor, also called adrenocortical adenoma, noncancerous, can be functioning or nonfunctioning.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of polyp that can become invasive rectal cancer over many years.&lt;SEP&gt;The most common type of polyp, which can become invasive rectal cancer over many years.&lt;SEP&gt;The most common type of polyp that can become invasive colon cancer over time.&lt;SEP&gt;The most common type of polyp, which can become invasive colon cancer over many years.&lt;SEP&gt;The most common type of colon polyp that can become invasive colon cancer over many years.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-058&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-059&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-121&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-123&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-124</data>
