      <data key="d2">A hereditary condition that may increase the risk of developing an adrenal tumor.&lt;SEP&gt;An inherited syndrome causing numerous polyps in the colon and rectum, often leading to colon cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;An inherited syndrome related to colon cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;An inherited syndrome related to thyroid cancer.</data>
