    <node id="Online Patient Portals">
      <data key="d0">Online Patient Portals</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Online Patient Portals are digital platforms provided by healthcare institutions that enable patients to access their medical information online. These web-based systems allow individuals to view their test results and other medical records, such as clinical notes and health history. Functioning as websites or dedicated health record accounts—with common examples including MyChart—these portals serve as a centralized hub for patient engagement. Beyond simply displaying data, they facilitate appointment tracking and scheduling, and provide secure communication channels for patients to interact with their care team. The information available on these platforms can often be downloaded or printed, allowing patients to compile physical copies, such as for a medical binder. Overall, Online Patient Portals are designed to give patients convenient, direct access to their health data and streamline their involvement in care management.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-054&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-075&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-101</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788682826</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
