      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Comprehensive documentation of a patient's medical history, test results, and treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Documents such as blood tests, imaging results, and reports about a patient's cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Documents containing a patient's health information, including test results and treatment history.&lt;SEP&gt;Documents containing a patient's medical history and treatment information.&lt;SEP&gt;Documents containing a patient's health information and test results.</data>
