    <node id="Second Opinion">
      <data key="d0">Second Opinion</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A consultation with another doctor to obtain an additional perspective on diagnosis or treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Consulting another doctor for a different perspective on diagnosis or treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Seeking another medical opinion, facilitated by having organized medical records.&lt;SEP&gt;Consultation with another doctor to confirm a diagnosis or treatment plan.&lt;SEP&gt;A review of test results and treatment plan by another doctor.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-100&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-101&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-196</data>
