    <node id="Health Care Provider">
      <data key="d0">Health Care Provider</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Health Care Provider is a medical professional who delivers healthcare services, such as a doctor or nurse, and provides care and treatment to patients. This role encompasses a broad range of duties, including performing physical exams and other assessments, evaluating symptoms, and recommending tests for conditions like bladder cancer. The provider also offers health care and guidance, which includes discussions on cancer screening, and may use tools like a mirror or fiberoptic scope to examine areas such as the oropharynx.

In addition to direct care, the Health Care Provider plays a key role in guiding patients through diagnostic and treatment processes. They receive imaging reports, discuss test results and treatment plans with patients, and provide information on next steps. Patients are encouraged to share family history information with this professional, who then uses that context to discuss results and options. The provider may also discuss genetic testing and refer patients to a genetic counselor when appropriate, ensuring comprehensive and informed care.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-066&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-092&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-104&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-105&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-106&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-127&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-128&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-157&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-174</data>
