    <node id="Actinic Keratoses">
      <data key="d0">Actinic Keratoses</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Pre-cancerous lesions that may be treated with superficial treatments, often in the same area as Bowen's disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Pre-cancerous skin lesions that can develop into squamous cell skin cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-011</data>
