      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A chemotherapy cream applied directly to the skin to treat early CSCC and actinic keratoses.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemotherapy medication applied topically to the skin to treat actinic keratosis.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-008</data>
