    <node id="Platinum">
      <data key="d0">Platinum</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">A metal contained in some chemotherapy medicines, such as cisplatin and carboplatin.&lt;SEP&gt;A metal contained in cisplatin, a chemotherapy drug for bladder cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-183</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788682875</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Radiation Oncologist">
      <data key="d0">Radiation Oncologist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Radiation Oncologist is a physician who specializes in the use of radiation therapy to treat cancer, determining the appropriateness of this treatment modality and prescribing, planning, and delivering it. As a medical expert, this doctor is responsible for creating treatment plans, often based on imaging such as CT scans, and for overseeing the entire course of radiation therapy. This specialist is an integral member of the multidisciplinary care team for various cancers, including being part of the assessment team for lung cancer, a key figure on the thyroid cancer treatment team, and a medical professional who devises and manages radiation therapy protocols for anal cancer. In all contexts, the Radiation Oncologist's role centers on the expert application of radiation to treat malignant diseases.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-079&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-108&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-118&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-120&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-136&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-138&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-148&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-150&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-176&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-189</data>
