      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A PD-1 inhibitor used to treat squamous cell skin cancer and other cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;An immunotherapy drug used in systemic therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A drug used to treat MSI-H/dMMR tumors and TMB-H tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;An immune checkpoint inhibitor used to treat metastatic anal cancer.</data>
