      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Rules for joining a clinical trial, such as age, cancer type and stage, treatment history, or general health.&lt;SEP&gt;Rules for joining a clinical trial, which may be about age, cancer type and stage, treatment history, or general health.&lt;SEP&gt;Rules for joining a clinical trial, which may be about age, cancer type and stage, treatment history, or general health. These requirements ensure participants are alike and the trial is as safe as possible.&lt;SEP&gt;Rules for joining a clinical trial, including age, cancer type and stage, treatment history, and general health.&lt;SEP&gt;Rules for joining a clinical trial, such as age, cancer type, and treatment history.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-117&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-140&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-149&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-184&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-193</data>
