    <node id="Immune Checkpoint Inhibitor">
      <data key="d0">Immune Checkpoint Inhibitor</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of immunotherapy that blocks checkpoint proteins, such as PD-1, to enhance the immune response against cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of immunotherapy that blocks proteins that prevent the immune system from attacking cancer cells, recommended for eligible patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of immunotherapy that blocks proteins that prevent the immune system from attacking cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of immunotherapy that blocks checkpoint proteins to enhance immune response against cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of drug used in immunotherapy to help the immune system fight cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of drug used in immunotherapy for cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-145&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-191&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-194</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788682884</data>
