      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A rating of how fast cancer is expected to grow and spread, based on how different tumor cells look from normal cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A rating of how fast doctors expect the cancer to grow and spread, based on how different tumor cells look from normal cells.&lt;SEP&gt;How abnormal cancer cells look under a microscope; part of staging.</data>
