    <node id="NCCN.org/patientguidelines">
      <data key="d0">NCCN.org/patientguidelines</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">NCCN.org/patientguidelines is the official website of the National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) dedicated to providing patient guidelines for cancer care. It serves as a central resource where NCCN Guidelines for Patients can be accessed, offering comprehensive information on a wide range of cancer types and related topics. The site covers specific conditions such as non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC), lung neuroendocrine tumors, Hodgkin lymphoma in children and adolescents, and cancers of the mouth and throat. Beyond disease-specific guidance, the platform addresses supportive care topics, including the management of side effects from immune checkpoint inhibitors, strategies for managing nausea, and resources for coping with distress. Additionally, the website provides patient guidelines and resources aimed at cancer survivorship, making it a multifaceted tool for patients, caregivers, and individuals seeking reliable, expert-reviewed information throughout the cancer journey.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-052&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-066&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-094&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-096&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-106&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-108&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-116&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-123&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-126&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-130&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-136&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-153&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-196</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
