      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The part of the body connecting the head to the trunk, where skin cancer is considered higher risk.&lt;SEP&gt;The region of the body where symptoms of head and neck cancer may appear.&lt;SEP&gt;Part of the body that may be scanned with CT to look for cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-052</data>
