    <node id="Platinum-based Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d0">Platinum-based Chemotherapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A chemotherapy regimen using platinum drugs, recommended in combination with radiation for some cases.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of chemotherapy using platinum-containing drugs like carboplatin, cisplatin, and oxaliplatin.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of chemotherapy using platinum-based drugs like carboplatin, cisplatin, and oxaliplatin, which can damage kidneys.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-046&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-193</data>
