    <node id="HIV">
      <data key="d0">HIV</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Human immunodeficiency virus, a condition that weakens the immune system and increases risk of CSCC.&lt;SEP&gt;The immunodeficiency virus that causes AIDS and is linked to primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Human immunodeficiency virus, which weakens the immune system and increases the risk of anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Human Immunodeficiency Virus, which increases the risk of developing anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Human immunodeficiency virus; a risk factor for anal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-112&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-186&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-187&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-188</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788682894</data>
