      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Plasma">
      <data key="d0">Plasma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Plasma is the clear, yellowish fluid component of blood, composed primarily of water, in which blood cells are suspended and float. It serves as the liquid medium of blood, carrying cells throughout the circulatory system.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-057&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-065&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-067&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-074&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-076</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788682915</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Support System">
      <data key="d0">Support System</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Network of friends, family, or peers providing assistance and emotional support.&lt;SEP&gt;Network of friends, family, or peers providing assistance during treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Friends, family, or peers who provide assistance and emotional support during diagnosis and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Friends, family members, or peers who provide transportation, meals, and emotional support during diagnosis and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A network of friends, family, or peers who provide assistance and emotional support during diagnosis and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Friends, family, or peers who provide transportation, meals, and emotional support during diagnosis and treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-064&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-065&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-075&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-173</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788682915</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Patient Portal">
      <data key="d0">Patient Portal</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Patient Portal is an online system or platform designed to give patients access to their personal health information. It enables users to view, download, and retrieve their medical records, including test results, imaging reports, and other health reports. The portal serves as a centralized digital space where patients can review their medical history and stay informed about their health status.

Beyond record access, the Patient Portal facilitates communication between patients and their healthcare providers. It allows patients to track appointments and interact with their care team, supporting ongoing care coordination. The system is intended to empower patients by providing convenient, secure access to their health data and fostering engagement with their own care process.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-052&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-071&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-096&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-100&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-101&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-128&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-155&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-163&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-170&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-173&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-178</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
