    <node id="Stomach Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Stomach Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of cancer that originates in the stomach; if it spreads to the lungs, it is still stomach cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A disease that affects the stomach.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer that starts in the stomach, most commonly adenocarcinomas, which begin in mucus-producing cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A disease characterized by the abnormal growth of cells in the stomach lining, often developing slowly over many years.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-161&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-162&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-163</data>
