    <node id="Secondhand Smoke">
      <data key="d0">Secondhand Smoke</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Smoke exhaled by another person and from the burning end of tobacco products; increases lung cancer risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Smoke exhaled by a smoker or from combustible tobacco products, which increases lung cancer risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Smoke exhaled by another person or from combustible tobacco products, which increases the risk of lung cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Inhalation of smoke from others' cigarettes, which increases bladder cancer risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Smoke exhaled by a smoker or from burning tobacco, which can increase cancer risk in others.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-174&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-178</data>
