      <data key="d0">Adenosquamous Carcinoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A subtype of non-small cell lung cancer that contains both adenocarcinoma and squamous cell carcinoma components.&lt;SEP&gt;A less common cervical cancer containing both squamous and adenocarcinoma cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A common type of cervical cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cervical cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-133&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-140&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-141</data>
