      <data key="d2">A document or resource that lists known risk factors for lung cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A document or book providing information and advice.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-066</data>
