      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Pharmaceutical aids to help quit smoking.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients might be given medicines to avoid effects of contrast allergies.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-037</data>
