      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Imaging tests that can detect SCLC, though less often before symptoms.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation used in imaging tests like CT scans and panoramic dental x-rays.&lt;SEP&gt;A form of high-energy radiation used in radiation therapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-109</data>
