      <data key="d0">Smooth Muscle</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Muscle type in the lower esophagus that is not under voluntary control.&lt;SEP&gt;Involuntary muscle type found in the lower esophagus and mixed in the middle esophagus.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-021</data>
