    <node id="Early-Stage Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Early-Stage Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Stage of esophageal cancer where the tumor has not grown beyond the inside of the esophagus and is not in lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer that has not spread extensively, often treated with surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;Cervical cancer that is confined to the cervix and has not spread extensively.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-140&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-142</data>
