    <node id="Brain">
      <data key="d0">Brain</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The brain is the organ located in the head that serves as the central control center for body functions, including feeling, moving, thinking, learning, memory, and other cognitive processes. It is a part of the central nervous system and is the primary site for several neurological conditions. Specifically, the brain is the organ most often affected by primary CNS lymphoma, where a lymphoma can cause various neurological symptoms, and it is also a location where primary CNS lymphoma can occur. Additionally, gliomas primarily grow in the brain, starting there and potentially disrupting brain functions; the brain is a common organ in the central nervous system where these tumors often arise.

In the context of cancer metastasis, the brain is a common site for the spread of esophageal cancer and breast cancer, and it is a possible site for breast cancer metastasis. It is also a less frequent site for distant metastasis of kidney cancer. Furthermore, the lining of the brain is a rare site for leukemia spread. In medical imaging, the brain is an organ that may normally appear bright on PET scans, a characteristic that is noted in standard diagnostic observations.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-053&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-064&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-072&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-094&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-096&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-112&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-113&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-115&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-135&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-164&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-165</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
