    <node id="Test Results">
      <data key="d0">Test Results</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Test Results refer to the outcomes of various medical diagnostic procedures, including blood tests, tissue tests, imaging studies, and biopsies. These results are essential for determining a patient's diagnosis, staging conditions such as cancer, and formulating an appropriate treatment plan. The information derived from these tests can take days or weeks to become available, depending on the complexity of the analysis. Once completed, test results are typically accessible to patients through online portals, allowing for convenient review, and are also discussed in detail with healthcare providers to guide clinical decisions. Overall, Test Results serve as a critical bridge between diagnostic procedures and subsequent medical management, ensuring that care is tailored to the specific findings of each individual case.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-066&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-106&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-172&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-196&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-098</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
