    <node id="Hodgkin Lymphoma">
      <data key="d0">Hodgkin Lymphoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A highly curable cancer that usually starts in lymph nodes in the upper body, most commonly diagnosed in people between ages 15 to 30 or after age 55.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer that affects the lymphatic system, with two main types: classic Hodgkin lymphoma and nodular lymphocyte-predominant Hodgkin lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of lymphoma characterized by the presence of Reed-Sternberg cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Another cancer that can develop from Richter transformation.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-145&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-169</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788682973</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Performance Status">
      <data key="d0">Performance Status</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Performance Status is a clinical measure of a patient’s ability to perform daily activities, reflecting their overall well-being, general level of fitness, and capacity for self-care. It is commonly evaluated using standardized scales, such as the ECOG (Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group) scale, which assigns a score to quantify a person’s functional capability. This assessment is widely used in cancer care, including in the context of follicular lymphoma (FL), where it informs treatment planning and helps guide therapeutic decisions. Performance Status serves as a key indicator for determining the appropriate level of treatment intensity and is also used to assess a patient’s eligibility for clinical trials. By evaluating how well a patient can manage ordinary day-to-day tasks, this metric provides clinicians with essential information to tailor care and predict a patient’s ability to tolerate specific interventions.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-064&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-068&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-075&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-095&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-096&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-114&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-128&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-154&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-163&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-166&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-170</data>
