    <node id="Reed-Sternberg Cells">
      <data key="d0">Reed-Sternberg Cells</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Oversized lymphocytes that are abnormally large and may have more than one nucleus, characteristic of Hodgkin lymphoma when viewed under a microscope.&lt;SEP&gt;Large lymphocytes that are characteristic of classic Hodgkin lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Large abnormal lymphocytes that may contain more than one nucleus, characteristic of Hodgkin lymphoma.</data>
