      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Tests that are part of diagnostic procedures for cancer, used to determine treatment plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagnostic techniques such as ultrasound or CT scans that help determine treatment plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Tests that take pictures of the inside of the body, used to determine treatment plan and staging.&lt;SEP&gt;Tests that produce images of the inside of the body, used for diagnosis and monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Tests such as MRI, CT, and PET scans that are used to guide the treatment plan for AML.&lt;SEP&gt;Tests that create pictures of the inside of the body, used to guide AML treatment.</data>
