    <node id="Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma">
      <data key="d0">Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A large and varied group of lymphomas that are not Hodgkin lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;A cancer of lymphocytes that begins in the lymphatic system.&lt;SEP&gt;A cancer that develops from lymphocytes, a type of white blood cell.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of blood cancers that include all types of lymphoma except Hodgkin's lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of blood cancers that include Burkitt lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of lymphomas that do not have Reed-Sternberg cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A cancer of lymphocytes, a type of white blood cell, that can develop when lymphocytes grow without proper regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-066&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-075&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-145&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-172</data>
