      <data key="d0">Cancer Stages</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Classifications of cancer extent, such as for intrahepatic bile duct cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Descriptions of the extent of cancer, used to reflect prognosis and guide treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The classification of cancer based on its extent and spread.&lt;SEP&gt;The extent to which cancer has spread in the body, used to guide treatment and prognosis.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-097&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-098</data>
