      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The mouth, including lips, gums, lining inside cheeks and lips, front two-thirds of tongue, floor of mouth, hard palate, alveolar ridge, and retromolar trigone.&lt;SEP&gt;The mouth area, including the lips, cheeks, gums, and tongue, which is examined during a head and neck exam.&lt;SEP&gt;Another name for the mouth.&lt;SEP&gt;The mouth area where cancer can occur.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-126</data>
