      <data key="d0">Hard Palate</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The hard, bony part of the roof of the mouth.&lt;SEP&gt;The hard, front part of the roof of the mouth behind the teeth.&lt;SEP&gt;The bone that forms the roof of the mouth, above which the nasal cavity lies.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-126</data>
