      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cancer of the nasopharynx, a type of head and neck cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer occurring in the nasopharynx, with more information available at NCCN.org.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer that can affect the eyes.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of head and neck cancer that occurs in the nasopharynx, often associated with EBV.</data>
