      <data key="d2">A hospital or center with extensive experience in treating head and neck cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A hospital or center with experience in treating head and neck cancer, recommended for treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical facility that is very experienced with pancreatic cancer, where the care team should work.</data>
