      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">An endocrine gland in the neck that can be affected by radiation therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;An endocrine gland in the neck that produces hormones regulating metabolism.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-128&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-147</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788682994</data>
