      <data key="d2">A professional who provides dietary advice to ensure adequate nutrition.&lt;SEP&gt;A nutrition expert who can help anal cancer survivors with diet changes.&lt;SEP&gt;A health care professional specializing in nutritional needs, particularly for anal cancer survivors.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-194&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-195</data>
