      <data key="d0">Mind And Body Therapists</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Therapists who help patients deal with the emotional and psychological aspects of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Therapists who help cancer patients cope with emotional and physical aspects of the disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Therapists who help patients deal with the emotional and psychological aspects of cancer diagnosis.</data>
