    <node id="Dentist">
      <data key="d0">Dentist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A dental professional who performs dental exams and cleanings.&lt;SEP&gt;A healthcare professional who performs procedures on teeth, jaws, and surrounding structures, and is involved in planning treatment for dentures, braces, extractions, and implants.&lt;SEP&gt;A health care professional who should be informed about head and neck cancer and with whom regular checkups are recommended.&lt;SEP&gt;A dental professional who should be informed about head and neck cancer and with whom regular checkups are recommended.&lt;SEP&gt;A health professional who performs dental cleanings and checkups, and may recommend dental work before cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A healthcare professional who cares for teeth and gums; important for patients with head and neck cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-128&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-130</data>
