    <node id="Pregnancy Test">
      <data key="d0">Pregnancy Test</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A test to determine if a person is pregnant, performed before starting treatment for those who can become pregnant.&lt;SEP&gt;A test to determine if a person is pregnant, often performed before starting cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A test to determine if a person is pregnant, given before starting cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A test given to those who can become pregnant before starting treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A test given to those who can become pregnant before treatment begins.&lt;SEP&gt;A test to determine if a patient is pregnant.&lt;SEP&gt;A test given before treatment to women who have the potential to become pregnant.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-052&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-101&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-128&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-155&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-170&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-171</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788682996</data>
