    <node id="Pregnancy">
      <data key="d0">Pregnancy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The state of carrying a developing fetus, which may need to be planned after cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The state of carrying a developing embryo or fetus; patients planning pregnancy should discuss with care team.&lt;SEP&gt;The state of carrying a developing fetus, which may be affected by cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The state of carrying a developing embryo or fetus; the text advises avoiding pregnancy during cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The state of being pregnant, which may affect treatment decisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-155&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-196</data>
