    <node id="Closed MRI">
      <data key="d0">Closed MRI</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">An MRI machine with a capsule-like design that surrounds the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;An MRI machine with a capsule-like design where the magnet surrounds the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;An MRI machine with a capsule-like design where the patient is enclosed within the magnet.&lt;SEP&gt;A more common MRI machine that fully encloses the patient, potentially causing claustrophobia.&lt;SEP&gt;An MRI machine with a capsule-like design where the magnet surrounds the patient, creating a small enclosed space.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of MRI machine with a capsule-like design where the magnet surrounds the patient, creating a small and enclosed space.&lt;SEP&gt;A traditional MRI machine that is more common than open MRI, with a capsule-like design where the magnet surrounds the patient.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-052&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-053&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-071&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-072&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-155&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-156</data>
