    <node id="Bright Spots">
      <data key="d0">Bright Spots</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Areas on PET scans that may indicate cancer or other conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer cells show up as bright spots on PET scans, but not all bright spots are cancer.</data>
