      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A PET/CT scan using sodium fluoride to detect bone metastases.&lt;SEP&gt;A PET/CT scan using sodium fluoride to detect bone metastases, may be unnecessary if FDG-PET/CT is clear.&lt;SEP&gt;An imaging test that may not be needed if FDG-PET/CT clearly shows cancer in the bone.</data>
