    <node id="Core Needle Biopsy (CNB)">
      <data key="d0">Core Needle Biopsy (CNB)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A biopsy technique using a larger needle to remove a core sample of tissue from a tumor or lymph node.&lt;SEP&gt;A biopsy technique using a core needle to remove a sample of tumor or lymph node.&lt;SEP&gt;A biopsy that removes more than one tissue sample through the same area on the breast.&lt;SEP&gt;A biopsy technique using a larger needle to remove a core of tissue from a tumor or lymph node. It is one of the needle biopsy types mentioned.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-054&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-103&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-129</data>
