    <node id="Chromosome">
      <data key="d0">Chromosome</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">A structure in cells that contains DNA and genes; normal human cells have 23 pairs.&lt;SEP&gt;Structures containing DNA and genetic information; normal human cells have 23 pairs.&lt;SEP&gt;Structures in cells that contain DNA; normal human cells have 23 pairs.&lt;SEP&gt;Structures that package DNA and contain genes.&lt;SEP&gt;A structure in cells that contains DNA and genetic information; normal human cells have 23 pairs.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-054&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-070&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-130</data>
