    <node id="PD-L1">
      <data key="d0">PD-L1</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Programmed death ligand 1, an immune protein that can suppress anti-tumor immune response when expressed on cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Programmed death-ligand 1, an immune protein that can suppress anti-tumor immune response.&lt;SEP&gt;A protein that can be tested to determine if targeted therapy or immunotherapy is an option.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-105&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-130&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-143</data>
