    <node id="Combined Positive Score (CPS)">
      <data key="d0">Combined Positive Score (CPS)</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A score measuring PD-L1 expression in tumor and immune cells, used to determine eligibility for immunotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A score measuring PD-L1 expression in tumor and immune cells, used to guide treatment decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;A scoring system used to measure the expression of PD-L1 in tumors, considering both tumor and immune cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-054&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-055</data>
