    <node id="Tumor Mutation Testing">
      <data key="d0">Tumor Mutation Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A test that examines tumor DNA for specific mutations to guide targeted therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A test that uses a sample of tumor or blood to identify specific DNA mutations in cancer cells, distinct from inherited genetic testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Testing tumor samples for specific DNA mutations, different from inherited genetic testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Testing tumor samples for specific DNA mutations to guide targeted therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Testing for mutations in tumors to inform treatment decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;A test using a sample of tumor or blood to see if cancer cells have specific DNA mutations.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-105&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-130&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-154&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-157</data>
