      <data key="d2">Another term for biomarker testing, used to identify genetic mutations or proteins in tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;Another name for genetic testing that looks for changes in leukemia cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Genetic testing performed on biopsy samples to identify specific biomarkers and tumor characteristics.</data>
