    <node id="Genomic Testing">
      <data key="d0">Genomic Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Another term for biomarker testing, used to analyze the entire genome of a tumor.&lt;SEP&gt;Another name for genetic testing that looks for changes in leukemia cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Another term for biomarker testing, analyzing the genetic makeup of tumor cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-085</data>
