    <node id="Jaw">
      <data key="d0">Jaw</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">A bone structure in the mouth that can be affected by head and neck cancer and its treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The jaw is a bone structure; nasopharyngeal cancer can spread to this area.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-131</data>
