      <data key="d2">Bodily fluid that can be used for genetic testing when AML cells are in remission.&lt;SEP&gt;Body fluid used for genetic testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A bodily fluid used for genetic testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A bodily fluid that can be used for genetic testing.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-092&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-105&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-178</data>
