      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Changes in a gene that might affect how the gene works, detected by next-generation sequencing.&lt;SEP&gt;Abnormal changes in genes that can turn normal cells into cancer cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-174</data>
