    <node id="Radiation">
      <data key="d0">Radiation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">MRI scans do not use x-rays, so no radiation is delivered during the test.&lt;SEP&gt;A cancer treatment that uses high-energy radiation to kill or shrink tumors, used for high-grade gliomas.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-168</data>
