      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Computed tomography, an imaging technique using x-rays.&lt;SEP&gt;Computed tomography scan, an imaging technique that uses x-rays to create detailed cross-sectional images of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Computed tomography; uses X-rays to create cross-sectional images.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of imaging test that uses contrast material.&lt;SEP&gt;Computed tomography, an imaging technique used similarly to MRI in brachytherapy planning.</data>
