      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The amount of blood pumped out of the left side of the heart with each beat; lower than normal indicates decreased heart function.&lt;SEP&gt;The amount of blood pumped out of the left side of the heart with each beat, used to assess heart function.</data>
