      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A small, round disc placed in the chest to deliver systemic therapy, fluids, and blood products.&lt;SEP&gt;A small disc placed under the skin to facilitate intravenous chemotherapy administration.&lt;SEP&gt;A small disc placed under the skin in the upper chest or abdomen to receive chemotherapy, inserted during minor surgery.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-046&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-047&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-073</data>
