      <data key="d0">Multidisciplinary Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A team of health care and psychosocial care professionals from different backgrounds who plan and implement treatment for a patient's cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A team of health care and psychosocial care professionals from different backgrounds who work together to plan and implement treatment for a patient.&lt;SEP&gt;A team of experts from different specialties that treats pancreatic cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of healthcare professionals from different specialties who collaborate on patient care.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-073&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-078&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-100</data>
