    <node id="Hematopathologist">
      <data key="d0">Hematopathologist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A specialist who analyzes cells and tissues from biopsies, providing diagnosis and biomarker information.&lt;SEP&gt;A specialist who analyzes blood and bone marrow samples to diagnose blood cancers like AML.&lt;SEP&gt;A specialist who diagnoses blood disorders and cancers by examining blood, bone marrow, and lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;A specialist who diagnoses cancers of blood and immune cells by examining blood, bone marrow, and lymph node samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A specialist who examines blood, bone marrow, and lymph node samples for signs of disease.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-073&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-145&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-169&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-170</data>
