      <data key="d0">Hematopoietic Cell Transplant</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A treatment that replaces damaged bone marrow with healthy stem cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A procedure to replace damaged bone marrow with healthy stem cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-072</data>
