    <node id="Lactate Dehydrogenase (LDH)">
      <data key="d0">Lactate Dehydrogenase (LDH)</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A tumor marker that may be elevated in less common ovarian cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;An enzyme that can be elevated in AML.&lt;SEP&gt;An enzyme found in most cells; dying cells and fast-growing cells release LDH into the blood.&lt;SEP&gt;An enzyme found in most cells; released into blood when cells die or grow rapidly, such as tumor cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-068&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-069&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-155</data>
