      <data key="d0">BRCA Mutation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A mutation in the BRCA genes, important for planning ovarian cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A genetic mutation increasing risk of ovarian cancer and influencing treatment options, particularly PARP inhibitor use.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-047</data>
