      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A DNA repair system; defects are biomarkers in ovarian cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A DNA repair system; defects are tested as biomarkers.&lt;SEP&gt;A biomarker indicating defects in DNA repair mechanisms.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-044&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-143</data>
