    <node id="Tumor Mutational Burden (TMB)">
      <data key="d0">Tumor Mutational Burden (TMB)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A biomarker measuring the number of mutations in a tumor.&lt;SEP&gt;A biomarker measuring the number of mutations in a tumor's genome.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of the number of mutations per million base pairs in tumor DNA; high TMB (TMB-H) is defined as 10 or more mutations per million base pairs.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-044&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-143</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788683054</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="BRAF V600E Mutation">
      <data key="d0">BRAF V600E Mutation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A specific gene mutation that is a biomarker in ovarian cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific mutation in the BRAF gene, tested as a biomarker.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-044</data>
