      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A common side effect of any surgery, including ovarian cancer surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;A potential complication of prostate biopsy, though anesthesia is used to minimize it.&lt;SEP&gt;A potential complication of invasive procedures like biopsy.&lt;SEP&gt;A physical discomfort that may affect cancer survivors.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-084&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-091&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-196</data>
