      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A more severe side effect of intraperitoneal chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A potential side effect of platinum-based chemotherapy, including cisplatin.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-047&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-193</data>
