      <data key="d2">A strategy of monitoring without active treatment, an option for some patients after chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A management strategy involving regular monitoring without active treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-047&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-141&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-046</data>
