      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A test for HPV-related status in throat cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A test for the p16 protein in biopsy samples to determine if HPV infection is present, used in throat cancer staging and treatment decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;A test recommended for people with throat (oropharyngeal) cancer to detect HPV infection, performed on a biopsy sample.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-052&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-055</data>
