    <node id="Distress">
      <data key="d0">Distress</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An unpleasant experience of mental, physical, social, or spiritual nature affecting feelings, thoughts, and actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Psychological distress commonly experienced by cancer patients and caregivers.&lt;SEP&gt;An unpleasant experience of mental, physical, social, or spiritual nature that can affect feelings, thoughts, and actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Emotional suffering or anxiety that can occur during cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;Emotional suffering that may affect cancer survivors.</data>
