      <data key="d2">The challenging process of quitting nicotine, often exacerbated by cancer stress.&lt;SEP&gt;The challenging process of quitting nicotine.&lt;SEP&gt;The challenging process of quitting nicotine, often exacerbated by stress from cancer.</data>
