      <data key="d2">A strain of HPV that can cause throat cancer, among other cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-risk strain of HPV.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-risk strain of human papillomavirus that is more likely to lead to anal cancer and other related cancers.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-052&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-133&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-185</data>
