    <node id="Anesthesia">
      <data key="d0">Anesthesia</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Anesthesia is a medical intervention that involves the use of drugs or other substances to induce a loss of feeling, sensation, or awareness, primarily to prevent pain during surgical or diagnostic procedures. It is commonly administered as a medication to numb a specific area or to put the patient to sleep, ensuring comfort and immobility during interventions such as biopsies, cystoscopy, and transurethral resection of a bladder tumor (TURBT). The practice encompasses both the substances used and the methods applied to achieve these effects, serving as a critical component of modern medicine to facilitate invasive procedures without causing distress or pain to the patient.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-084&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-091&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-108&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-114&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-167&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-176&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-178&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-180&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-129</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788683060</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Vulvar Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Vulvar Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cancer of the vulva, which can be associated with HPV.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer caused by HPV.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer caused by HPV, affecting the vulva.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer caused by HPV, and a history of it increases the risk of anal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-052&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-133&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-185&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-186</data>
