      <data key="d2">A website URL where patients can complete an online survey about the NCCN Guidelines for Patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A website where patients can complete a survey about NCCN Guidelines for Patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A website where patients can complete an online survey about the NCCN Guidelines for Patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A website link for an online survey about the NCCN Guidelines for Patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A web address where patients can complete a survey about the NCCN Guidelines for Patients.</data>
