      <data key="d0">TNM Scores</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A staging system that describes tumor size (T), lymph node involvement (N), and metastasis (M).&lt;SEP&gt;A system that describes the tumor size (T), lymph node involvement (N), and distant metastasis (M).&lt;SEP&gt;A staging system that describes the extent of cancer based on tumor, node, and metastasis.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-106&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-172</data>
