      <data key="d0">Bone Marrow Tests</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Tests that examine bone marrow samples to diagnose and monitor blood cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Tests performed on bone marrow samples to diagnose blood cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Tests that remove and examine samples of bone marrow to diagnose leukemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Tests that examine bone marrow samples to diagnose blood cancers.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-058&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-066&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-069&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-075</data>
