      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A radioactive substance injected into the bloodstream for PET and bone scans to highlight areas of interest.&lt;SEP&gt;A substance injected into the body for PET scans to highlight cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A substance injected into the body for imaging tests like bone scans, which accumulates in areas of bone damage.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-083&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-090&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-091</data>
