      <data key="d0">Prostate Biopsy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A procedure to sample prostate tissue to confirm the presence of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific biopsy procedure to sample prostate tissue, often guided by ultrasound or MRI.&lt;SEP&gt;A biopsy procedure specifically targeting the prostate gland, usually performed by a urologist using a needle guided by ultrasound.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific type of biopsy used to sample prostate tissue.</data>
