    <node id="Urologist">
      <data key="d0">Urologist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A doctor who specializes in diseases of the urinary system and male reproductive organs, typically performs prostate biopsies.&lt;SEP&gt;A doctor specializing in diseases of the urinary system and male reproductive organs, who typically performs prostate biopsies.&lt;SEP&gt;A specialist in the urinary system and male reproductive organs, who performs procedures like cystoscopy.&lt;SEP&gt;A doctor who performs cystoscopy and can remove small cancer growths or take biopsy samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A doctor who specializes in the urinary tract and performs TURBT procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical professional specializing in the urinary tract, who discusses treatment options with patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical professional who specializes in the urinary tract and male reproductive system, involved in diagnosing and treating bladder cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-084&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-091&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-176&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-177&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-180&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-181&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-185</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788683077</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
