      <data key="d2">A gene that, when mutated, is associated with increased cancer risk.&lt;SEP&gt;A mismatch repair gene; mutations are linked to Lynch syndrome and increased risk of colorectal, uterine, and prostate cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A gene involved in DNA repair.</data>
