      <data key="d2">A gene that, when mutated, is associated with increased cancer risk.&lt;SEP&gt;A gene involved in DNA repair; mutations are associated with increased cancer risk, including prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A gene involved in DNA repair.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-084&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-085&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-092</data>
