    <node id="Hereditary Mutation">
      <data key="d0">Hereditary Mutation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A mutation present in every cell of the body, inherited from parents.&lt;SEP&gt;A mutation passed down in families.&lt;SEP&gt;A genetic mutation passed down in families that can increase the risk of bladder cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-092&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-112&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-174</data>
