      <data key="d0">Androgen Deprivation Therapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A hormone therapy that reduces testosterone levels to slow or shrink prostate cancer growth.&lt;SEP&gt;A treatment that reduces testosterone to very low levels, used for prostate cancer.</data>
