    <node id="Breast">
      <data key="d0">Breast</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">An organ and gland on the chest, composed of milk ducts, lobules, fat, nerves, lymph and blood vessels, ligaments, and connective tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;An organ and gland on the chest made of milk ducts, lobules, fat, nerves, lymph and blood vessels, ligaments, and connective tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;The organ on the chest that contains lobules, ducts, fat, and other tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;An organ and gland on the chest made of milk ducts, fat, nerves, lymph and blood vessels, ligaments, and connective tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;The organ in the chest that produces milk, consisting of lobules and ducts.&lt;SEP&gt;Organ in the chest, site of breast cancer, often imaged and biopsied.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-094&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-095&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-096&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-097&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-098&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-099&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-100&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-103</data>
