    <node id="Inflammatory Breast Cancer (IBC)">
      <data key="d0">Inflammatory Breast Cancer (IBC)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A rare and aggressive form of breast cancer where cancer cells block lymph vessels in the skin, causing redness and swelling.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of breast cancer that is usually invasive ductal carcinoma and is often stage 3 or 4 at diagnosis.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-100&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-106</data>
