      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">An enzyme in the blood; high levels may indicate cancer spread to bone or liver.&lt;SEP&gt;An enzyme found in the blood; high levels may indicate bone tumors, liver disorders, or pregnancy.</data>
