      <data key="d0">Sodium Fluoride PET-CT</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of PET-CT scan using sodium fluoride as a tracer, sometimes used instead of a bone scan.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of PET-CT that uses a radiotracer made of sodium fluoride, sometimes used instead of a bone scan.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-102&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-103</data>
