      <data key="d0">Incisional Biopsy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A biopsy that removes a small amount of tissue through a cut in the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;A biopsy removing only part of a lymph node.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-103&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-170</data>
