    <node id="Excisional Biopsy">
      <data key="d0">Excisional Biopsy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A biopsy that removes the entire abnormal area, not preferred but may be necessary.&lt;SEP&gt;A biopsy removing an entire lymph node.&lt;SEP&gt;A procedure to remove all or part of a lymph node by cutting into the skin for diagnostic testing.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-103&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-170&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-187</data>
