    <node id="HER2">
      <data key="d0">HER2</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Human epidermal growth factor receptor 2, a protein involved in normal cell growth that can be overexpressed in some breast cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A protein whose status is part of biomarker testing for breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A protein that can promote cancer growth; status affects treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A protein on cancer cells that can drive growth; its expression guides systemic treatment and HER2-targeted therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A protein involved in normal cell growth that may be present in higher amounts in some breast cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A protein that can be overexpressed in some cancers, relevant for targeted therapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-104&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-105&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-108&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-109&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-110&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-143</data>
