    <node id="G3">
      <data key="d0">G3</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The highest grade for breast cancers, indicating a higher risk of recurrence.&lt;SEP&gt;High grade, indicating higher risk of recurrence.&lt;SEP&gt;Poorly differentiated (high grade) cancer cells that look very different from normal cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A cancer grade indicating poorly differentiated (high grade).</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-107&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-108&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-159&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-190</data>
