      <data key="d0">Chest Wall</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The structure surrounding the lungs, which can be invaded by T4 tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;The area of the body where radiation therapy may be given after mastectomy.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-107&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-109</data>
