      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Noninvasive breast cancer stage; cancer is confined to ducts or lobules.&lt;SEP&gt;The earliest stage of bladder cancer, affecting only the inner lining of the bladder. It has two subgroups: Stage 0a and Stage 0is.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-108&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-179</data>
