      <data key="d0">Stage IV</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Metastatic breast cancer stage; cancer has spread to distant sites.&lt;SEP&gt;The most advanced stage of cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-108&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-159</data>
