    <node id="Pembrolizumab">
      <data key="d0">Pembrolizumab</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">An immunotherapy drug, also known as Keytruda, used in cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A checkpoint inhibitor drug (Keytruda) used for dMMR/MSI-H cancers before colectomy.&lt;SEP&gt;An immune checkpoint inhibitor (immunotherapy) used to treat cancers with certain biomarkers, also known as Keytruda.&lt;SEP&gt;The generic name for Keytruda, a checkpoint inhibitor used for bladder cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-111&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-125&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-145&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-183</data>
