      <data key="d0">Luteinizing Hormone-Releasing Hormone (LHRH)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A hormone made by the hypothalamus that tells the ovaries and testicles to make sex hormones; also called GnRH.</data>
