      <data key="d0">Confusion</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A state of disorientation, a possible symptom.&lt;SEP&gt;State of being bewildered or unclear, a possible symptom of primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-112&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-113</data>
