      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Difficulty remembering, a possible symptom.&lt;SEP&gt;Difficulties with memory that can occur as a symptom of primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-112&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-113</data>
