    </node>
    <node id="Nausea">
      <data key="d0">Nausea</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Feeling of sickness with an inclination to vomit, a neurological symptom.&lt;SEP&gt;Feeling of sickness in the stomach that can be a symptom of primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Common side effect of EBRT.&lt;SEP&gt;A common side effect of cancer therapy, which can be managed.&lt;SEP&gt;A short-term side effect of radiation therapy for anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A common side effect of chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A feeling of sickness in the stomach, a possible side effect of treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-112&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-113&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-138&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-184&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-189&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-190&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-196</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788683082</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Vomiting">
      <data key="d0">Vomiting</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Expelling stomach contents through the mouth, a neurological symptom.&lt;SEP&gt;Expelling the contents of the stomach through the mouth, a possible symptom of primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;A common side effect of cancer therapy, which can be managed.&lt;SEP&gt;A common side effect of chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;The act of expelling stomach contents, a possible side effect of treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-112&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-113&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-184&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-190&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-196</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788683082</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Seizures">
      <data key="d0">Seizures</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Sudden, uncontrolled electrical disturbances in the brain, a neurological symptom.&lt;SEP&gt;Sudden, uncontrolled electrical disturbances in the brain that can be a symptom of primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-112&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-113</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788683082</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Blurry Vision">
      <data key="d0">Blurry Vision</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Loss of sharpness of vision, a possible symptom.&lt;SEP&gt;Loss of sharpness of vision, which can occur as a symptom of primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-112&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-113</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788683082</data>
