    <node id="Colectomy">
      <data key="d0">Colectomy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Surgical removal of part or all of the colon.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgical removal of part or all of the colon, mentioned as a procedure after which ctDNA testing may detect microscopic disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgery to remove the part of the colon with cancer, with open and minimally invasive methods.&lt;SEP&gt;A surgical procedure to remove all or part of the colon, used to treat colon cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-122&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-123&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-124&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-125</data>
