      <data key="d0">Survivorship</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The phase of care focusing on long-term side effects and healthy habits after cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The phase of care after treatment focusing on monitoring for recurrence and managing long-term health.&lt;SEP&gt;Part 3 of the guide, providing information on managing long-term effects of treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Focuses on physical, emotional, and financial issues unique to cancer survivors.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-122&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-143&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-189&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-194&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-152</data>
