      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A drug used with 5-FU to enhance its effectiveness in chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemotherapy drug used in FOLFOX and FOLFCIS regimens for metastatic anal cancer.</data>
