      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A chemotherapy regimen for colon cancer, typically given for 6 months.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemotherapy regimen consisting of 5-FU, leucovorin, and oxaliplatin, used for metastatic anal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-125&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-192</data>
