      <data key="d0">Nasopharyngeal Carcinoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of cancer that affects the nasopharynx, which connects the back of the nose to the back of the mouth.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer that affects the nasopharynx, the area connecting the back of the nose to the back of the mouth.&lt;SEP&gt;Nasopharyngeal carcinoma (NPC) is a type of cancer that starts in the nasopharynx, the upper part of the throat behind the nose.&lt;SEP&gt;A cancer that starts in the nasopharynx, specifically squamous cell carcinoma of the nasopharynx.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-126&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-127&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-131&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-132</data>
