    <node id="Programmed Cell Death Protein 1">
      <data key="d0">Programmed Cell Death Protein 1</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">A protein on immune cells that, when bound to PD-L1, can suppress immune response; targeted by some immunotherapies.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-130</data>
