    <node id="Numbered Stages">
      <data key="d0">Numbered Stages</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Numbered stages range from stage 0 to stage 4, with 4 being the most advanced, based on TNM scores.&lt;SEP&gt;Stages from 1 to 4 indicating the extent of cancer, with 4 being most advanced.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-131&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-159</data>
