      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Fat and connective tissue surrounding the uterus and cervix, connecting them to the pelvis.&lt;SEP&gt;The tissue around the cervix.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-132&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-135</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788683082</data>
