    <node id="Cervical Dysplasia">
      <data key="d0">Cervical Dysplasia</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Abnormal cell changes on the surface of the cervix, also known as cervical intraepithelial neoplasia (CIN).&lt;SEP&gt;Abnormal cell changes on the cervix, classified as CIN 1, 2, or 3, with HSIL being pre-cancerous.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-132&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-133</data>
