      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Grading system for cervical dysplasia based on depth of abnormal cells, with grades 1, 2, or 3.&lt;SEP&gt;Another term for cervical dysplasia, graded as CIN 1, 2, or 3.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-132&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-133</data>
