      <data key="d0">High-Grade Squamous Intraepithelial Lesion (HSIL)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Moderate or severe dysplasia, corresponding to CIN 2 and 3, considered a pre-cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Moderate to severe dysplasia (CIN 2 and 3), considered pre-cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-132&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-133</data>
