      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Another name for the squamo-columnar junction, where most cervical cancers and pre-cancers start.&lt;SEP&gt;The area of the cervix where most cervical cancers and pre-cancers start.&lt;SEP&gt;The area where the ectocervix and endocervix meet, where most cervical cancers start.</data>
