      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A vaccine protecting against 9 HPV strains, available in the US, recommended for ages up to 45.&lt;SEP&gt;A vaccine that protects against 9 different strains of HPV, including the highest-risk strains. It is recommended for routine use in adolescents and young adults, and is an option for adults aged 45 and under.</data>
