      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">A high-risk strain of HPV.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-risk strain of human papillomavirus that is more likely to lead to anal cancer and other related cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-risk strain of HPV that is more likely to lead to anal cancer and other related cancers.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-133&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-185&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-186</data>
