      <data key="d2">A doctor who specializes in fertility and reproductive health.&lt;SEP&gt;A doctor specializing in fertility, whose opinion may be sought when considering fertility-sparing treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-135&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-141</data>
