    <node id="Cystoscopy">
      <data key="d0">Cystoscopy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A procedure to see inside the bladder and urinary tract using a cystoscope.&lt;SEP&gt;A procedure to look for signs of cancer in the bladder, often performed under anesthesia.&lt;SEP&gt;A test that looks inside the bladder to diagnose bladder cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A procedure that uses a scope to visually examine the inside of the bladder.&lt;SEP&gt;A procedure to look inside the urethra and bladder for signs of cancer using a cystoscope.&lt;SEP&gt;An exam to look inside the urethra and bladder for signs of cancer, using a cystoscope to view and take biopsies or remove small tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;A procedure that uses a viewing device inserted through the urethra to look for cancer inside the bladder, often performed in an operating room with anesthesia.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-135&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-137&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-174&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-175&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-176&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-177&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-178</data>
