    <node id="Muscle Flap Reconstruction">
      <data key="d0">Muscle Flap Reconstruction</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A procedure using muscle from another area to reconstruct the vagina.&lt;SEP&gt;A surgical technique using tissue from another part of the body, often the rectus abdominis muscle, to improve healing of the perineum after APR.&lt;SEP&gt;A surgical technique to rebuild tissue after APR, using muscle from elsewhere in the body. The text asks if this will be performed.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-144&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-192&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-197</data>
