    <node id="Classical Hodgkin Lymphoma">
      <data key="d0">Classical Hodgkin Lymphoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A subtype of Hodgkin lymphoma with specific characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of lymphoma characterized by the presence of Reed-Sternberg cells, one of the features seen in mediastinal gray zone lymphoma.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-145&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-146</data>
