    <node id="CD20">
      <data key="d0">CD20</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A protein marker on B-cells; if present on tumor cells, rituximab may be added to chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A surface protein commonly found on CLL cells, used to identify the cancer type.&lt;SEP&gt;A protein found on the surface of B cells, often used as a marker.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-146&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-169&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-170</data>
