    <node id="Thyroid Hormone">
      <data key="d0">Thyroid Hormone</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A collective term for thyroxine (T4) and triiodothyronine (T3), produced by the thyroid.&lt;SEP&gt;Hormones produced by the thyroid gland that regulate metabolism.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-146&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-147</data>
