      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">A mineral in the bloodstream, controlled by parathyroid glands.&lt;SEP&gt;A mineral supplement recommended to strengthen bones during thyroid cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A mineral needed for healthy teeth, bones, and other body tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;A mineral essential for bone formation and maintenance.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-146&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-148&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-155&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-157</data>
