      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The U.S. Food and Drug Administration, which approves drugs, devices, or treatment approaches that are found safe and effective in clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;The U.S. Food and Drug Administration, which approves drugs and treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;The U.S. Food and Drug Administration, which approves investigational treatments.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-149&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-150&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-194</data>
