      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Radioactive iodine therapy, a treatment for thyroid cancer, mentioned as a standard treatment that targeted therapy is used when RAI therapy cannot be performed.&lt;SEP&gt;Radioactive iodine therapy used to destroy remaining thyroid tissue or cancer cells after surgery.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-149&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-152</data>
