    <node id="Liver Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Liver Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cancer that starts in the liver (primary) or spreads to the liver (secondary).&lt;SEP&gt;A disease characterized by the uncontrolled growth of cells in the liver. It can spread directly through the liver or metastasize to distant sites such as the lung or bone.&lt;SEP&gt;A disease that can be detected through screening and diagnosed with imaging tests.</data>
