      <data key="d0">Multidisciplinary Care Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A team of health care providers from different specialties who work together to treat a patient's bladder cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A team of specialists and care providers who work together to treat bladder cancer, including doctors, nurses, and other healthcare professionals.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-175&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-176</data>
