      <data key="d0">Quitting Smoking</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The act of stopping smoking, which is recommended as part of bladder cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;The act of stopping smoking, which can reduce cancer risk and improve treatment outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-175&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-178</data>
