      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The increased likelihood of developing cancer due to genetic factors passed down in families.&lt;SEP&gt;The increased likelihood of developing cancer due to inherited genetic mutations.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-175&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-178</data>
