      <data key="d0">Ureter</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A tube that carries urine from the kidney to the bladder, which may be investigated if cancer is not found in the urethra or bladder.&lt;SEP&gt;A tube that carries urine from the kidney to the bladder.</data>
