      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Imaging using contrast solution with CT or MRI to see how well the urinary tract is working.&lt;SEP&gt;An imaging test that uses contrast and CT or MRI to visualize the lining of the urinary tract, including kidneys, ureters, and bladder, to detect abnormalities such as tumors or blockages.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-177&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-178</data>
