      <data key="d0">Renal Ultrasound</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Painless, non-surgical test using sound waves to produce black and white images of kidneys and other organs.&lt;SEP&gt;A painless, non-surgical imaging test that uses sound waves to produce real-time black and white images of the kidneys, ureters, and bladder.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-177&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-178</data>
