    <node id="Fertility Preservation Options">
      <data key="d0">Fertility Preservation Options</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Various methods to enable having children after cancer treatment, including sperm banking, egg freezing, ovarian tissue banking, and ovarian transposition.</data>
