    <node id="Anoscopy">
      <data key="d0">Anoscopy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A procedure to examine the anal canal, recommended after anal cancer diagnosis.&lt;SEP&gt;A procedure to examine the anal canal using an anoscope, recommended at intervals after treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A procedure to examine the anus and lower rectum, recommended every 6 to 12 months for 3 years after treatment for lymph node recurrence without APR.&lt;SEP&gt;A procedure to examine the anus, used in surveillance after treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-189&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-191&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-192&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-194</data>
