    <node id="Intensity-Modulated Radiation Therapy (IMRT)">
      <data key="d0">Intensity-Modulated Radiation Therapy (IMRT)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">An advanced radiation technique that uses many small beams of different intensities to target tumors while sparing surrounding tissue, preferred for anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;An advanced radiation technique preferred for treating anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of radiation therapy that delivers precise radiation doses to a tumor while minimizing exposure to surrounding healthy tissue. The text asks if it is offered.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-189&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-190&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-197</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788683089</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
