    <node id="Metastatic Anal Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Metastatic Anal Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Anal cancer that has spread to other parts of the body (stage IV), treated with systemic therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Anal cancer that has spread to distant areas such as the liver or lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;Anal cancer that has spread beyond the pelvis, most often to the liver or lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;Anal cancer that has spread to other parts of the body, often treated with radiation and chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Anal cancer that has spread to other parts of the body, treated with chemotherapy and possibly immunotherapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-189&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-191&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-192&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-193&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-194</data>
