      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A chemotherapy drug used in combination regimens for anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemotherapy drug used in combination with capecitabine or 5-FU for perianal cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemotherapy drug used in combination with capecitabine or 5-FU for recurrent anal cancer in lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemotherapy drug used in regimens with capecitabine or 5-FU for anal cancer.</data>
