    <edge source="Care Team" target="Patient">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">(Care Team, Patient) is a relationship in which a care team provides medical care, support, and guidance to a patient. This interaction is bidirectional, as the patient actively engages with the care team by asking questions and taking notes during appointments. The relationship emphasizes a collaborative approach, where patients are encouraged to participate in shared decision-making with their care team. The care team’s role encompasses delivering medical treatment, offering informational support, and providing overall assistance to the patient throughout their care journey.</data>
      <data key="d9">healthcare,healthcare provision,interacts with,provides care,provides care to</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-053&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-064&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-075&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-100&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-154</data>
