    <edge source="Metastasis" target="TNM System">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The M in TNM describes metastasis.&lt;SEP&gt;Metastasis (M) is a component of the TNM system, indicating whether cancer has spread to distant parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The M category in the TNM system indicates whether cancer has spread to distant parts of the body.</data>
