    <edge source="Metastasis" target="Biopsy of Metastasis">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Biopsy of metastasis is performed to confirm cancer presence in areas where cancer has spread.&lt;SEP&gt;A biopsy of metastasis is performed to confirm the presence of cancer in metastatic sites.</data>
