    <edge source="Metastasis" target="Prostate Cancer">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Advanced prostate cancer is characterized by metastasis, the spread to other body areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Advanced-stage prostate cancer has spread outside the prostate to other areas, a process called metastasis.&lt;SEP&gt;Metastasis refers to the spread of prostate cancer to other parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Prostate cancer may metastasize to lymph nodes, bones, or internal organs.</data>
