    <edge source="Cervical Cancer" target="Atrophy">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Atrophy is a condition that can occur in the vagina, but it is not directly related to cervical cancer; however, it is mentioned in the context of cervical cancer treatment side effects.</data>
