    <edge source="Cervical Cancer" target="Locally Advanced Cancer">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Locally advanced cervical cancer is often treated with chemoradiation.&lt;SEP&gt;Locally advanced cancer is a category of cervical cancer that has grown beyond the cervix.</data>
