    <edge source="Prostate Cancer" target="Active Surveillance">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Early-stage prostate cancer can be managed with active surveillance instead of immediate treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Active surveillance is a management option for low-risk prostate cancer.</data>
