    <edge source="Prostate Cancer" target="Hormone Therapy">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Prostate cancer can be treated with hormone therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Hormone therapy is a treatment for advanced-stage prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Hormone therapy is a systemic treatment for prostate cancer that adds, blocks, or removes hormones.&lt;SEP&gt;Hormone therapy has been the main treatment for advanced prostate cancer for decades.</data>
      <data key="d9">mainstay,systemic,treated by,treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-081&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-088&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-093&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-094</data>
