    </edge>
    <edge source="Prostate Cancer" target="PSA Test">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The PSA test is used to screen for prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;PSA test measures prostate-specific antigen levels, which can be elevated in prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;The PSA test is used to detect the possibility of prostate cancer and to monitor patients after diagnosis.</data>
      <data key="d9">biomarker,detect,monitor,screening,screens for</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-081&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-083&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-089</data>
