      <data key="d8">Levothyroxine is used as thyroid hormone replacement therapy to suppress TSH and prevent thyroid cancer cells from growing.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients with thyroid cancer continue to take levothyroxine to keep TSH levels down.</data>
      <data key="d9">medication,suppresses,treats</data>
