    <edge source="Thyroid Cancer" target="Radioactive Iodine (RAI) Therapy">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">RAI therapy is used to treat thyroid cancer, especially differentiated types that take up iodine, to lower recurrence risk or treat spread.&lt;SEP&gt;RAI therapy may be used after total thyroidectomy to kill remaining cancer cells.</data>
      <data key="d9">targets,treated with,treats</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-148&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-150</data>
