    <edge source="Thyroid Cancer" target="Thyroidectomy">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Thyroidectomy is a surgical procedure to remove the thyroid gland, often performed as part of thyroid cancer treatment before RAI therapy.</data>
