    <edge source="Thyroid Cancer" target="External Beam Radiation Therapy (EBRT)">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">EBRT uses high-energy radiation to destroy thyroid cancer cells, particularly for anaplastic thyroid cancer or when surgery and RAI are not effective.&lt;SEP&gt;EBRT is used for aggressive, recurrent, or metastatic thyroid cancers.</data>
      <data key="d9">destroys,treated with,treats</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-148&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-150</data>
